From: Bastiaan van der Plaat <bastiaan.v.d.plaat@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 22:18:38 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Add the DS Rumble Pak

A Rumble Pak in the GBA slot rumbles when the player takes damage,
longer for more damage, and when firing a gun. The pak only moves while
it is switched back and forth, a tick task does that at 60 Hz for as
long as the rumble lasts. Without a pak, and on the DSi which has no
GBA slot, nothing changes. The demos don't rumble.

The main menu has Control again, between Sound and Quit, with only
Rumble Enabled, always shown, which rumbles once enabled. It is kept at
the end of the config right away, older configs keep it off.
